cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Indexer Replay Oracle (iro) in research or teaching, please cite this software."
title: "Indexer Replay Oracle (iro)"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Rana
    given-names: Jahanzaib
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7085-0440"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ranajahanzaib/indexer-replay-oracle"
license: MIT
abstract: "iro tests whether an application's persistent event projection survives real-world replay conditions. It feeds offline canonical blockchain events to a consumer, injects duplicate deliveries, triggers process restarts, exercises a negotiated crash-after-commit boundary, and compares normalized projection state."
keywords:
  - blockchain
  - indexer
  - replay-testing
  - fault-injection
  - event-sourcing
